td.paragraph:
Do not exceed 20 mg once daily. In patients at increased risk for rhabdomyolysis [see 

                                          Warnings and Precautions (5.1)
                                       ], consider dosages less than 20 mg per day.

In patients taking ticagrelor, do not exceed a dosage of CRESTOR 20 mg once daily. In patients at increased risk for rhabdomyolysis [see 

                                          Warnings and Precautions (5.1)
                                       ], consider dosages less than 20 mg per day.
